        "id": 62791,
        "name": "Spiff",
        "username": "Spiff",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-09T15:18:34.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I believe it's been decided that since the effect states when it will end, the effect lingers until the time stated. &nbsp;Other effects which state no time limit, such as \"+1 damage dealt\" effects, are considered to be only on as long as the card providing the effect is still in play.</p>",
