        "created_at": "2013-05-10T02:13:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I've always played it where the brambles (or in fixer's case the hoist chain) aren't there to wrap up the hero/villain they were affecting anymore so the effect goes away.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>i might be playing it wrong, but to me it feels right that way.</p>",
